      "translationZh": "Microsoft Foundry 上的 Grok 4.6",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b80b54897ce3073",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.6 现已可通过 Microsoft Foundry 使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "12838a9001d0afc4",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们很高兴地宣布，Grok 4.6 现已在 Microsoft Foundry 上推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f201e2ea2a3615f8",
      "translationZh": "Grok 4.6 是我们最新的旗舰模型，专为长时间运行的智能体以及具有雄心的交互式和视觉工作打造。它提供 500k 的上下文窗口，以及可配置的推理力度（low、medium、high、xhigh）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "13d9afcf3574fec4",
      "translationZh": "如需了解有关该模型的更多信息，请阅读 Grok 4.6 发布公告。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0e060ad1aa0a6031",
      "translationZh": "在 Microsoft Foundry 上使用 Grok 4.6 进行构建",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e05733472416eb4",
      "translationZh": "Foundry 为组织提供一个统一平台，用于将 Grok 4.6 与其他前沿模型进行对比评估、运行针对特定工作负载的测试、部署托管端点，并在企业级安全与治理控制下运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "033ab11f1d546284",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在构建编程智能体、工程辅助助手、研究助手或企业自动化系统，可以从 Foundry 模型目录开始。有关部署详情，请参阅 Microsoft 的公告《Grok 4.6 comes to Microsoft Foundry Models》以及我们的 Microsoft Foundry 集成指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
